"""
Eduvia — Alembic Migrations

This directory contains Alembic database migration scripts.

## Usage

```bash
# Create a new migration
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description_of_change"

# Apply pending migrations
alembic upgrade head

# Rollback one migration
alembic downgrade -1

# Show migration history
alembic history

# Show current version
alembic current
```

## Important Notes

1. Always set DATABASE_URL in your .env before running migrations
2. Review autogenerated migrations before applying them
3. Never edit migration files after they have been applied to production
4. The --autogenerate flag detects changes in app/database/base.py subclasses
"""